Icons in this folder never follow the chosen pack.

The window control glyphs (window-close, window-maximize, window-minimize,
window-restore) are part of Sonora and carry the licence in COPYING.

The brand marks (applemusic, deezer, firefoxbrowser, lastfm, spotify, tidal, youtubemusic) come from
Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org), released under CC0 1.0. Each mark stays the
trademark of its owner and is used only to point at that service.

The scrobbling services' marks below are single-colour redrawings of each service's own logo,
and each stays the trademark of its owner, used only to point at that service:

- listenbrainz: the ListenBrainz monochrome icon by the MetaBrainz Foundation,
  https://github.com/metabrainz/design-system (brand/logos/ListenBrainz), licensed under
  CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Rescaled to this folder's
  24 px grid; the rescaled mark is shared under the same licence.
- librefm: the Libre.fm arcs from the GNU FM source (clients/sailfish/qml/images/librefm.svg),
  whose project is licensed under the AGPL 3.0. Merged into one colour.
- maloja: traced from the Maloja icon (maloja/web/static/png/favicon_large.png) in
  https://github.com/krateng/maloja, whose project is licensed under the GPL 3.0.
- tealfm: traced from the teal.fm icon (apps/site/public/favicon.ico) in
  https://github.com/teal-fm/teal, whose project is licensed under the MIT licence.

The middle-scroll anchor (scroll) is part of Sonora and carries the licence in COPYING.

The app mark (sonora) is part of Sonora and carries the licence in COPYING.
